.TH QUADRF-PSD 1 "August 2026" "QuadRF" "QuadRF"
.SH NAME
quadrf-psd \- power spectral density plot for the QuadRF front-end
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B quadrf-psd
.SH DESCRIPTION
Maps the CSI driver's ring buffer, runs a 4096-point FFT over it and draws the
resulting spectrum, with an IQ histogram beside it. There are no command-line
options; everything is adjusted from the keyboard while it runs.
.SH KEYS
.TP
.B Space
Switch between one-channel packed and four-channel interleaved mode. The
spectrum history is cleared so the two do not ghost into each other.
.TP
.BR Up ", " Down
Move the whole dB window up or down by 5 dB.
.TP
.BR Left ", " Right
Move the top of the dB window only.
.TP
.B r
Reset the dB window.
.TP
.B Escape
Quit.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR quadrf-rf-vision (1),
.BR quadrf-nearfield (1),
.BR quadrf-jtag (1)
